@startuml
title UML state machine diagram - Farm Management System

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> MainArea : [Successful login]
SignIn --> Error : [Invalid credentials]

MainArea --> MarketConditions : [Select market conditions]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : [Select pest control help]
MainArea --> SoilInfo : [Provide soil information]
MainArea --> Location : [Provide location]

state MarketConditions <<choice>>
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : [View market report]

state PestControlHelp <<choice>>
PestControlHelp --> Techniques : [View pest control techniques]

state SoilInfo <<choice>>
SoilInfo --> CropSuggestions : [Provide crop suggestions]

state Location <<choice>>
Location --> LabourDetails : [View labour availability details]
Location --> WeatherInsights : [View weather insights]

MainArea --> Continue : [Continue using service]
SignOut --> EndSession : [Log out]

title UML state machine diagram - Online Marketplace

[*] --> Registration : [Register as user]
state Registration <<choice>>
Registration --> Seller : [Join as seller]
Registration --> Customer : [Join as customer]

Seller --> AddProduct : [Add new product]
Seller --> PromoteProduct : [Promote existing product]
Seller --> Communicate : [Communicate with customers]
Seller --> Logout : [Log out]

Customer --> SignIn : [Sign in and access personal dashboard]
Customer --> Explore : [Explore products on platform]
Customer --> Search : [Search available products]
Customer --> Purchase : [Proceed with purchase]
Customer --> BrowseStop : [Stop browsing]
Customer --> Logout : [Log out]

title UML state machine diagram - Equihealth

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> Patient : [Enter as patient]
SignIn --> HealthWorker : [Enter as health worker]
SignIn --> GovernmentOfficial : [Enter as government official]

Patient --> MedicalInfo : [Provide medical information]
HealthWorker --> Analyze : [Analyze provided information]
HealthWorker --> Alerts : [Prepare alerts based on analysis]
GovernmentOfficial --> HealthPlanningResults : [View health planning results]
HealthWorker --> PlannedActivities : [View planned activities]
HealthWorker --> Logout : [Log out]
Patient --> Logout : [Log out]
@enduml
